Hi {Owner},

I build websites for IV therapy and wellness clinics around {City}. {Business Name} has a strong feed, but nowhere a new client can see what's in each drip, how screening works or book a chair without sending a message.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: a priced drip menu, a screening and nursing page, mobile IV zones, memberships and online booking, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

It makes no health claims, and your medical director signs off the wording. If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and menu changes. If not, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes this week?

